{%- comment -%}
  ichillpod.com — "Notify me when available" FALLBACK. Not the recommended path.
  Primary path is a Back in Stock app (see docs/NOTIFY_ME_WHEN_AVAILABLE.md §3–§6).

  What this is:   a Custom Liquid block for the Dawn product template. Renders only while the
                  product is unavailable (Coming Soon / sold out) and disappears by itself once
                  inventory is restored.
  Where to paste: Theme editor → Products → Default product → section "Product information"
                  → Add block → Custom Liquid → paste → drag directly under "Buy buttons" → Save.
                  Stored in that theme's templates/product.json. No theme code files are edited.
  What it stores: a Shopify Customer with email-marketing consent, tagged `chillpod-waitlist`
                  (same built-in `form 'customer'` mechanism as Dawn's footer newsletter block;
                  Shopify may interpose its /challenge captcha page on submit).
  What it does NOT do: send anything. On restock day you send a Shopify Email campaign to the
                  segment `customer_tags CONTAINS 'chillpod-waitlist'` (runbook §7a).
  Revert:         remove the block in the theme editor → Save. Customers created remain; do not
                  bulk-delete them.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- unless product.available -%}
  <div class="chillpod-notify" style="margin-top: 1.2rem;">
    {%- form 'customer', id: 'ChillpodNotifyForm', class: 'chillpod-notify__form' -%}
      <input type="hidden" name="contact[tags]" value="newsletter, chillpod-waitlist">

      {%- if form.posted_successfully? -%}
        <p class="form__message" id="ChillpodNotifyForm-success" tabindex="-1" autofocus>
          Thanks — we'll email you the moment the iChillPod is available.
        </p>
      {%- else -%}
        <div class="field" style="display: flex; gap: 0.8rem; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: stretch;">
          <label class="visually-hidden" for="ChillpodNotifyEmail">Email</label>
          <input
            id="ChillpodNotifyEmail"
            class="field__input"
            type="email"
            name="contact[email]"
            value="{{ form.email }}"
            placeholder="Email"
            autocomplete="email"
            autocorrect="off"
            autocapitalize="off"
            aria-required="true"
            required
            style="flex: 1 1 14rem; position: static;"
            {% if form.errors %} aria-invalid="true" aria-describedby="ChillpodNotifyForm-error"{% endif %}
          >
          <button type="submit" class="button button--secondary" style="flex: 0 0 auto;">
            Notify me when available
          </button>
        </div>

        {%- if form.errors -%}
          <small class="form__message" id="ChillpodNotifyForm-error" role="alert" style="display: block; margin-top: 0.6rem;">
            {{ form.errors.translated_fields.email | capitalize }} {{ form.errors.messages.email }}
          </small>
        {%- endif -%}

        <p class="caption" style="margin: 0.6rem 0 0;">
          One email when it's back in stock. Unsubscribe anytime.
        </p>
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endform -%}
  </div>
{%- endunless -%}
